    "title": "scripts: validate the first Comments-URI entry",
    "user": {
      "login": "grandpig",
      "id": 229586679,
      "node_id": "U_kgDODa829w",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229586679?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/grandpig",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/grandpig/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "The `Comments-URI` validation condition was reversed when the field was made optional.\r\n\r\n`$found{'Comments-URI'}` is incremented only after the current header line has been processed. As a result, the existing condition skipped validation for the first entry and applied it to continuation entries instead.\r\n\r\nThis allowed a nonstandard first `Comments-URI` to pass, while rejecting a valid external discussion URI following the standard Comments wiki URI.\r\n\r\nRestore the original condition so that only the first entry must match:\r\n\r\n    https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/wiki/Comments:BIP-NNNN\r\n\r\nAdditional continuation entries remain unrestricted.",
    "labels": [
      {
        "id": 9045094857,
        "node_id": "LA_kwDOAN28mc8AAAACGyExyQ",
